#6=IFCPROJECT('344V6dm0XSu9JWKZ5yQzD8',#5,'Eaton Pow-R-Line 4 panelboard - parametric equipment spec','Single-equipment model of the Eaton Pow-R-Line 4 style panelboard from the customer''s Claude Design panel-meta.js: 480Y/277 V, 3-phase 4-wire, 400 A bus, main breaker, 42 spaces, 65 kA SCCR, surface mounted. Enclosure W 0.508 m x H 1.372 m x D 0.190 m; insertion point = bottom-centre of the enclosure back, mounting height 1.067 m (bottom of enclosure) so the top of panel sits at ~2.44 m. Door swing and NEC 110.26 working clearance are recorded as PanelSchedule properties, never as solid geometry. Occurrence data (PanelSchedule, Pset_ElectricDistributionBoardTypeCommon) lands as instance parameters; catalogue data (Pset_ManufacturerTypeInformation) lands on the shared type.',$,'EQ-PRL4-400MB-42',$,(#20),#10);
